/*
 * Localized display names for ship outfitting modules.
 *
 * Source: the in-game module localisation tables.
 *
 * Credit and licence terms: ATTRIBUTIONS.md. Acquisition, revisions, derivation and
 * known gaps: data/i18n/SOURCES.md.
 *
 * `nameKeys` maps each Frontier symbol to a shared localized-name record. Each `names`
 * record carries the canonical English display name, which the owning module catalogue
 * remains authoritative for, and the five other locales the source publishes. Two
 * records hold English alone — the unreleased Large Planetary Vehicle Hangars, which no
 * acquired localisation table names yet; see data/i18n/SOURCES.md.
 *
 * A record key is the English name it holds. A few names need more than one record,
 * because the game distinguishes in other locales what English spells the same way: a
 * `#2` suffix separates those. `Lightweight Alloy` and `Reinforced Alloy` are singular
 * on some hulls and plural on the rest, `Hatch Breaker Limpet Controller` is generic on
 * one symbol and specific on the others, and one Corrosion Resistant Cargo Rack differs
 * from its siblings. The suffix is part of the key only, never of a displayed name.
 */
